    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d611">

                <pb facs="0639" n="527" sameAs="frus:frus1910/pg527"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 24607/5.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The British Minister for Foreign Affairs to the
                        Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1910-05-09"><hi rendition="#italic">May 9,
                        1910</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I am very grateful to you for your kind message of sympathy in the irreparable
                    loss which my country has sustained.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Edward Grey.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
